      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just noticed that:\n\nView All Members\n\nAllows role to view all members in a group, not just friends.\n\nAlready exists, though for this canny having the ability to fully block view access (even seeing if friends are a member) would still be appreciated. some people have pretty extensive friend lists so having this flag on, not much would happen from it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
