  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-01T09:41:44.468Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Allow the admin to dictate whether the member-list is visible to members with this permission.\n\nFor safety reasons (especially for very large groups) it might be better to hide the extended memberlist from a member of a specific rank.\n\nShould someone malicious have issues with a specific group, seeing the entire group memberlist might make it easy for someone to target members of a group for harassment",
